#@gui :_=note("<small><b>Description:</b>\n This filter allows to quickly extract foreground objects from background in opaque RGB images. Click on the <i>Apply</i> or <i>OK</i> buttons below to open the interactive window and start adding foreground and background control points. When you're done, exit the interactive window: your extracted foreground will be transferred back to the host software.\n\n If you are not satisfied with the result, click on <i>Apply</i> once again to modify your control points defined previously. To remove all control points, click on the <i>Reset</i> button above. </small>")
#@gui :_=value(0,0)
