pass.
+luminance[0] rv[1,2] r[0,1] {100*$1/$2}%,{100*$1/$2}%,1,100%,2 quantize[1] 6,0
*.. $2 channels.. 0,1 r.. {$2*100}%,{$2*100}%
$2,$2,1,2,"c?y:x" r. ...,...,1,2,0,2 +[-3,-1] +warp. ..,0,0,1 rm...
